    "reasoning": "An intact conceptual living cell separates division arrest, continuing metabolism and variable secretions. The neighbor panel requires actual cell/signal/time/environment tests. Low proliferation with p21 is insufficient; no fixed SASP, universal irreversible duration, inevitable relapse, aging/quiescence/exhaustion synonym or therapy rule is introduced.",
