    "learnerTask": "Distinguish durable division arrest in living cells from death and from the separate effects of secretions.",
    "gap": "The active-workshop analogy is useful but no image separates division, metabolism and messages. A compact living-cell schematic with those independent axes and a context-dependent neighbor panel would clarify why low proliferation/p21 is insufficient and why SASP effects are separate tests.",
